wsLink-module-scss-module__SYM2iG__iconH4"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20"><path d="M0 0h20v20H0z" fill="none"></path><path data-name="1" fill="#6F7F93" d="M4.283 5.071a.9.9 0 0 0 0 1.275l3.51 3.51-3.51 3.51a.902.902 0 0 0 1.275 1.275l4.152-4.152a.9.9 0 0 0 0-1.275L5.558 5.062a.909.909 0 0 0-1.275.009z"></path><path data-name="2" fill="#6F7F93" d="M11.283 5.071a.9.9 0 0 0 0 1.275l3.51 3.51-3.51 3.51a.902.902 0 0 0 1.275 1.275l4.152-4.152a.9.9 0 0 0 0-1.275l-4.152-4.152a.909.909 0 0 0-1.275.009z"></path></svg></div><a target="_self" class="ArrowsLink-module-scss-module__SYM2iG__link" href="/researchers/promotion"><h4 class="color-text-70">Learn how Research Square Videos can boost the impact of your research</h4></a></div></div><div class="b- b-pt-25 b-pb-25 is-hidden-tablet"><a href="https://vimeo.com/researchsquare/albums" class="cta color-cta-b4">Browse videos</a></div></div></div></section><section class="section color-bg-w"><div class="columns"><div class="column is-12"><div class="level section-title"><div class="level-left"><h3 class="color-text-b4 caps">Featured Subjects</h3></div></div><div class="border-bottom b-mb-10"></div><div class="columns"><div class="column is-12  FeaturedSubjects-module-scss-module__YY4zgq__subjectAreas"><a href="/browse?subjectArea=Anesthesiology%20%26%20Pain%20Medicine">Anesthesiology &amp; Pain Medicine</a><a href="/browse?subjectArea=Cancer%20Biology">Cancer Biology</a><a href="/browse?subjectArea=Computational%20Biology">Computational Biology</a><a href="/browse?subjectArea=Dentistry">Dentistry</a><a href="/browse?subjectArea=Developmental%20Biology">Developmental Biology</a><a href="/browse?subjectArea=Epigenetics%20%26%20Genomics">Epigenetics &amp; Genomics</a><a href="/browse?subjectArea=General%20Microbiology">General Microbiology</a><a href="/browse?subjectArea=Infectious%20Diseases">Infectious Diseases</a><a href="/browse?subjectArea=Internal%20Medicine">Internal Medicine</a><a href="/browse?subjectArea=Neurology">Neurology</a><a href="/browse?subjectArea=Oncology">Oncology</a><a href="/browse?subjectArea=Pediatrics">Pediatrics</a><a href="/browse?subjectArea=Physiology">Physiology</a><a href="/browse?subjectArea=Psychology">Psychology</a><a href="/browse?subjectArea=Structural%20Biology">Structural Biology</a></div></div></div></div></section></div><div class="main-section" label="For Researchers"><section class="section color-bg-10"><section class="section is-paddingless color-bg-b4"><div class="columns"><div class="CallToActionBar-module-scss-module___73Bva__column b-mv-10 b-mh-15-m"><h2 class="CallToActionBar-module-scss-module___73Bva__type color-text-w b-pr-20">How can we support your research? </h2><div class="CallToActionBar-module-scss-module___73Bva__levelItem"><a href="https://support.researchsquare.com/" class="cta color-cta-line-b4 CallToActionBar-module-scss-module___73Bva__buttonPadding" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" data-track="click_contact_us_button" data-track-context="Contact us button click from home page footer bar">Contact Us</a></div></div></div></section></section></div></div></div><footer class="section b-pb-60-d b-pb-20-m"><div class="tw-justify-between tw-block tw-p-4 tw-space-y-6 lg:tw-space-x-6 lg:tw-space-y-0 rs-container lg:tw-flex"><div class="tw-max-w-lg tw-b-mb-20"><a href="/"><img class="logo-rs" src="/static/img/logos/logo-rs.svg" alt="Research Square"/></a><p class="footer-desc b-pb-15">Research Square lets you share your work early, gain feedback from the community, and start making changes to your manuscript prior to peer review in a journal.</p><p class="footer-desc">As a division of Research Square Company, we’re committed to making research communication faster, fairer, and more useful. We do this by developing innovative software and high quality services for the global research community. Our growing team is made up of researchers and industry professionals working together to solve the most critical problems facing scientific publishing.</p><div class="icons is-flex b-pt-25 b-pb-20"><a href="https://twitter.com/researchsquare" rel="nofollow"><img src="/static/img/icons/icon-twitter.svg" alt="Twitter logo"/></a><a href="https://www.facebook.com/researchsquare" rel="nofollow"><img src="/static/img/icons/icon-facebook.svg" alt="Facebook logo"/></a><a href="https://www.youtube.com/c/researchsquare" rel="nofollow"><img src="/static/img/icons/icon-youtube.svg" alt="YouTube logo"/></a><a href="https://www.instagram.com/researchsquarecompany/" rel="nofollow"><img src="/static/img/icons/icon-instagram.svg" alt="Instagram logo"/></a><a href="https://www.linkedin.com/company/research-square-co" rel="nofollow"><img src="/static/img/icons/icon-linkedin.svg" alt="LinkedIn logo"/></a></div><div class="researcher-app"><a href="https://www.researcher-app.com/?utm_source=researchsquare&amp;utm_medium=referral&amp;utm_campaign=&amp;utm_content=logo" class="align-m" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><h6 class="color-text-90 b-pr-10">Also discoverable on</h6><img src="/static/img/logos/logo-researcher-app.svg" alt="ResearcherApp logo"/></a></div></div><div class="tw-justify-between tw-block tw-space-y-6 lg:tw-space-x-6 lg:tw-space-y-0 lg:tw-flex"><div id="platform"><h5 class="caps color-text-b4 b-mt-3 b-pb-15 b-mr-40-d">Platform</h5><p class="footer-link"><a href="/researchers/preprints">About</a></p><p class="footer-link"><a href="/researchers/in-review">In Review</a></p><p class="footer-link"><a href="/legal/editorial">Editorial Policies</a></p><p class="footer-link"><a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" data-track="click_contact_us_button" data-track-context="Contact us button click footer help center" href="https://support.researchsquare.com">Help Center</a></p></div><div id="resources"><h5 class="caps color-text-b4 b-mt-3 b-pb-15 b-mr-20-d">Resources</h5><p class="footer-link"><a href="/researchers">Author Services</a></p><p class="footer-link"><a href="/accessibility">Accessibility</a></p><p class="footer-link"><a href="/request-api">API Access</a></p><p class="footer-link"><a href="/rss.xml" rel="alternate" type="application/rss+xml">RSS feed</a></p><p class="footer-link"><button data-cc-action="preferences">Manage Cookie Preferences</button></p></div></div></div></footer><footer class="section columns tail"><div class="column is-narrow is-paddingless"><div class="navbar"><p class="navbar-item">© Research Square <!-- -->2026<!-- --> | ISSN 2693-5015 (online)<!-- --> </p><a class="navbar-item" href="/legal/privacy">Privacy Policy</a><a class="navbar-item" href="/legal/terms-of-service">Terms of Service</a><a class="navbar-item" href="/legal/do-not-sell-my-personal-information">Do Not Sell My Personal Information</a></div></div></footer></div></div></div><script id="__NEXT_DATA__" type="application/json">{"props":{"pageProps":{"configuration":{"journal":{"name":"Research Square","identity":"researchsquare","logo":false,"directSubmit":true,"showInReviewInBrowserTitle":false,"showJournalNav":false,"filterSubjectAreas":false,"article":{"citationFormat":"${authors} ${title}, ${postedDate}, PREPRINT (Version ${version}) available at Research Square [https://doi.org/${doi}]","showBadges":true,"showPdf":true,"showPeerReviewFeatures":true,"submitForQcEnabled":true,"versionDisclaimer":"Please note that this article has not completed peer review."},"blurb":"A new pre-publication platform making research communication faster, fairer, and more useful.","dashboard":{"submissionUrl":"/submission"},"discover":{"showArticleStatusSearch":true,"showArticleTypeSearch":true},"home":"landing","login":{"title":"Research Square","copy":"A new pre-publication platform making research communication faster, fairer, and more useful.","embeddedVideo":true},"submission":{"pages":[{"route":"abstract","field":"manuscriptAbstract","name":"Abstract","tooltip":"Please do not put keywords in the abstract box; use the keywords section instead.","require